#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/multispectral-thermal-ov5640.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/multispectral-thermal-ov5640.rst:6
msgid "Multispectral Thermal (OV5640)"
msgstr "Termocamera multispettrale (OV5640)"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/multispectral-thermal-ov5640.rst:4
msgid ""
"The OV5640 variant of the Multispectral Thermal Camera Module pairs a 5MP "
"rolling-shutter colour sensor with a FLIR Lepton thermal core, so the OpenMV"
" Cam can run high-resolution colour-vision and thermal pipelines side by "
"side."
msgstr ""
"La variante OV5640 del modulo Multispectral Thermal Camera abbina un sensore"
" a colori rolling-shutter da 5MP a un nucleo termico FLIR Lepton, così la "
"OpenMV Cam può eseguire affiancate pipeline di visione a colori ad alta "
"risoluzione e pipeline termiche."

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/multispectral-thermal-ov5640.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `Multispectral Thermal "
"product page <https://openmv.io/products/multispectral-thermal-camera-"
"module>`_."
msgstr ""
"Per il datasheet completo, le foto e le informazioni d'ordine, consulta la "
"`pagina prodotto Multispectral Thermal "
"<https://openmv.io/products/multispectral-thermal-camera-module>`_\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/multispectral-thermal-ov5640.rst:16
msgid "Supported on the OpenMV Cam RT1062 only."
msgstr "Supportato solo sulla OpenMV Cam RT1062."

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/multispectral-thermal-ov5640.rst:19
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Punti salienti"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/multispectral-thermal-ov5640.rst:21
msgid "OV5640: 5MP rolling shutter for higher-resolution colour"
msgstr "OV5640: rolling shutter da 5MP per colori a risoluzione più elevata"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/multispectral-thermal-ov5640.rst:22
msgid "Accepts FLIR Lepton 1.x / 2.x / 3.x thermal cores"
msgstr "Accetta nuclei termici FLIR Lepton 1.x / 2.x / 3.x"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/multispectral-thermal-ov5640.rst:23
msgid "Simultaneous thermal + colour processing on one module"
msgstr "Elaborazione termica + a colori simultanea su un unico modulo"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/multispectral-thermal-ov5640.rst:24
